{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超在禮賓府主持勳銜頒授典禮。<br/>\n<br/>\n今年有466人獲頒勳銜及嘉獎，其中陳健波、劉遵義及林廣兆，獲頒最高榮譽的大紫荊勳章。而在大埔宏福苑火災殉職的消防隊目何偉豪，獲追授金英勇勳章。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:09:14.144839+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:41:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:55:31.395594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:02:50.728691+00:00","content_hash":"3ea84aff4eeacb5f95dd9134f27cf3e97453986063588a939bfca8cbace4936f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}